:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Lord of Ruin Jagando]].''
'''Jagando Jr.''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked at a 100% chance when beating the [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)/Invasion|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji Invasion]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

